### 正常下单成功：订单 PAID、库存减少、支付成功
@orderNo = SAGA-{{$uuid}}

POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "{{orderNo}}",
  "productId": "SKU-1001",
  "quantity": 2,
  "amountCents": 19900,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### 库存节点失败：补偿 CreateOrder -> CancelOrder
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "{{orderNo}}",
  "productId": "SKU-1001",
  "quantity": 2,
  "amountCents": 19900,
  "failAt": "INVENTORY"
}

### 支付节点失败：补偿 RestoreInventory -> CancelOrder
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "{{orderNo}}",
  "productId": "SKU-1001",
  "quantity": 2,
  "amountCents": 19900,
  "failAt": "PAYMENT"
}

### 最后订单状态更新失败：完整逆序补偿 RefundPayment -> RestoreInventory -> CancelOrder
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "{{orderNo}}",
  "productId": "SKU-1001",
  "quantity": 2,
  "amountCents": 19900,
  "failAt": "ORDER_UPDATE"
}

### 查询订单 / 库存 / 支付流水
GET http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/orders/SAGA-20261109-HTTP-004

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8082/api/inventory/SKU-1001

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8083/api/payments/SAGA-20261109-HTTP-004

### 零元订单：不传券，跳过支付，最终 COMPLETED
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "{{orderNo}}",
  "productId": "SKU-1001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "amountCents": 0,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### 优惠券子状态机：1000 分减 500 分，实际支付 500 分
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "{{orderNo}}",
  "productId": "SKU-1001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "amountCents": 1000,
  "couponCode": "SAVE500",
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### 优惠后零元：跳过支付，优惠券仍核销
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "{{orderNo}}",
  "productId": "SKU-1001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "amountCents": 700,
  "couponCode": "FREE1000",
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### 在全新示例券上测试子流程补偿；请先执行此例，再测试上面的成功核销
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "{{orderNo}}",
  "productId": "SKU-1001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "amountCents": 1000,
  "couponCode": "SAVE500",
  "failAt": "COUPON"
}

